[2025-04-15 21:50:32,150][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Earlier this year, Microsoft made MFA mandatory on all Azure logins - but in an age of increasingly sophisticated attacks against identities, this might not be enough.&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fduo.com%2Fresources%2Fwebinars%2Fuse-duo-to-knock-the-microsoft-mfa-requirement-for-azure-out-of-the-park%3Futm_medium=publisher-direct%26utm_source=TLDR-InfoSec%26utm_campaign=roi_q32025_duo-whitespace-BTMSFT-ODW1%26utm_content=ODW-knock-the-MSFT%26utm_term=20250409/3/010001961fdb0477-098cac9a-8e61-4a72-ad10-c88c589962ec-000000/k-tEj3zbBMT2qNYR91Xts0fe-R37MODB6gAEffyKs-s=400&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Continuous Identity Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; looks beyond the scope of authentication alone to incorporate both identity and device context.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:32,151][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:32,151][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "&lt;p&gt;Watch this &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fduo.com%2Fresources%2Fwebinars%2Fuse-duo-to-knock-the-microsoft-mfa-requirement-for-azure-out-of-the-park%3Futm_medium=publisher-direct%26utm_source=TLDR-InfoSec%26utm_campaign=roi_q32025_duo-whitespace-BTMSFT-ODW1%26utm_content=ODW-knock-the-MSFT%26utm_term=20250409/4/010001961fdb0477-098cac9a-8e61-4a72-ad10-c88c589962ec-000000/UvvjJBlH4dLRiOH_wfE3_qfD0ZNYqzXcHs4Fdprm0P4=400&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;recorded webinar by Cisco Duo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to learn how to:&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
