[2025-04-15 21:50:32,422][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    A data leak at GenNomis, an AI image site, exposed explicit deepfake material, including images of minors and celebrities. This incident raises concerns about unmonitored AI-generated content and underlines the need for improved security measures and responsible AI development. Cybersecurity researcher Jeremiah Fowler emphasized the importance of detecting and preventing harmful deepfakes.[\n]"
