[2025-04-15 21:50:32,470][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    The openSNP project will close on April 30, deleting user data due to privacy and misuse concerns. Co-founder Bastian Greshake Tzovaras cited changes in data abuse and privacy landscapes. Users can download their data before this date without manual actions needed.[\n]"
