[2025-04-15 21:50:32,551][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Critical secrets are leaking from both code repositories and collaboration tools like Slack, Jira, and Confluence, with 38% classified as critical or urgent compared to 31% in source code. Only 7% of secrets overlap between these platforms, creating separate vulnerabilities that are often overlooked in environments seen as &quot;safe&quot; yet prone to compromise.[\n]"
