[2025-04-15 21:50:32,597][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Zhou Shuai is a Chinese hacker that first started hacking in his senior year of high school in 1996. Shuai&apos;s early motivations as a founding member of Green Army were idealistic as he sought to be a hacktivist vigilante. Shuai eventually ended up becoming more commercial and less idealistic and is now designated as APT27 and sanctioned by the U.S. Department of the Treasury.[\n]"
