[2025-04-15 21:50:32,664][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Agent-based scanners and legacy approaches have failed to keep up with real-world attacks, creating a false sense of security while missing exposures that are actively being exploited. And they fail to protect unmanageable and unknown assets[0xe2][0x80][0xa6]&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So while you&apos;re chasing CVEs and playing alert whack-a-mole, attackers are probing for exposures they can exploit right now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.runzero.com%2Fplatform%2F%3Futm_source=tldr-sec%26utm_medium=email-sponsored%26utm_campaign=rz-product-launch-2025/3/01000195d7bccdc4-0038d1da-1275-4c42-8c15-73453ceb5a78-000000/8GbcJlTbUCnh5c5SASz8cYb37djUHMFmh_bvamgY-pQ=398&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;runZero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; eliminates dangerous blind spots, providing internal and external attack surface visibility across IT, OT, IoT, mobile, and cloud. Using &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.runzero.com%2Ftry%2F%3Futm_source=tldr-sec%26utm_medium=email-sponsored%26utm_campaign=rz-product-launch-2025/1/01000195d7bccdc4-0038d1da-1275-4c42-8c15-73453ceb5a78-000000/XWT0wKVSxhoIM3FUzy_TZ7gw7bidrqFvijM3cU9zEuc=398&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;advanced fingerprinting and novel discovery techniques&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (no agents or authentication required), runZero uncovers exposures that others miss, and prioritizes what actually matters.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
