[2025-04-15 21:50:32,669][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    ReaderUpdate macOS malware loader has evolved to other languages such as Go and Rust. Initially a Python binary, it targets x86 Intel systems through third-party software sites, deploying adware and potentially serving as a pay-per-install platform for threat actors.[\n]"
