[2025-04-15 21:50:32,681][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Troy Hunt of Have I Been Pwned recently fell for a phishing email that claimed his Mailchimp privileges were restricted, redirecting him to a site that stole his login and MFA code. The email&apos;s legitimacy was convincing, and fatigue combined with Outlook for iOS not displaying the email address contributed to his error. However, 1Password&apos;s lack of autofill should have prevented it. Hunt also questioned why Mailchimp kept unsubscribed emails and has added the breached email list to his site.[\n]"
