[2025-04-15 21:50:33,452][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDHSCISA/2020/06/3486054/05152023-gov-delivery-banner-copy_original.png&quot; alt=&quot;Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA)&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,452][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;You are subscribed to Cybersecurity Advisories for Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency. This information has recently been updated and is now available.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,452][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2025/03/31/cisa-adds-one-known-exploited-vulnerability-catalog&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 120%; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;CISA Adds One Known Exploited Vulnerability to Catalog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,452][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_item&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 2em;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,452][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_pub_date&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 90%; font-style: italic; color: #666666; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;03/31/2025 04:00 PM EDT&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_description&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA has added one new vulnerability to its &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; title=&quot;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&quot;&gt;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&lt;/a&gt;, based on evidence of active exploitation.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2024-20439&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2024-20439&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;CVE-2024-20439&lt;/a&gt; Cisco Smart Licensing Utility Static Credential Vulnerability&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;These types of vulnerabilities are frequent attack vectors for malicious cyber actors and pose significant risks to the federal enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/binding-operational-directive-22-01&quot; title=&quot;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]established the Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog as a living list of known Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs) that carry significant risk to the federal enterprise. BOD 22-01 requires Federal Civilian Executive Branch (FCEB) agencies to remediate identified vulnerabilities by the due date to protect FCEB networks against active threats. See the&lt;a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/Reducing_the_Significant_Risk_of_Known_Exploited_Vulnerabilities_211103.pdf&quot; title=&quot;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&quot;&gt;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]for more information.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Although BOD 22-01 only applies to FCEB agencies, CISA strongly urges all organizations to reduce their exposure to cyberattacks by prioritizing timely remediation of[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; title=&quot;Catalog vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Catalog vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]as part of their vulnerability management practice. CISA will continue to add vulnerabilities to the catalog that meet the[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities&quot; title=&quot;specified criteria&quot;&gt;specified criteria&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_item&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,453][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_description&quot;&gt;[\n]"
