[2025-04-15 21:50:33,549][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,549][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Organizations should report incidents and anomalous activity to CISA[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s 24/7 Operations Center at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:Report@cisa.gov&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Report@cisa.gov&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Report@cisa.gov&lt;/a&gt; or (888) 282-0870.[0xe2][0x80][0xaf][0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
