[2025-04-15 21:50:33,561][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_pub_date&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 90%; font-style: italic; color: #666666; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;03/13/2025 01:45 PM EDT&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
