[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDHSCISA/2020/06/3486054/05152023-gov-delivery-banner-copy_original.png&quot; alt=&quot;Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA)&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;You are subscribed to Cybersecurity Advisories for Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency. This information has recently been updated and is now available.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_item&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 2em;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_title&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 120%; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2025/03/12/cisa-and-partners-release-cybersecurity-advisory-medusa-ransomware&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;CISA and Partners Release Cybersecurity Advisory on Medusa Ransomware&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;CISA and Partners Release Cybersecurity Advisory on Medusa Ransomware&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_pub_date&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 90%; font-style: italic; color: #666666; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;03/12/2025 02:00 PM EDT&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_description&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Today, CISA[0xe2][0x80][0x94]in partnership with the Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) and Multi-State Information Sharing and Analysis Center (MS-ISAC)[0xe2][0x80][0x94]released joint Cybersecurity Advisory, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/cybersecurity-advisories/aa25-071a&quot; title=&quot;#StopRansomware: Medusa Ransomware&quot;&gt;#StopRansomware: Medusa Ransomware&lt;/a&gt;. This advisory provides tactics, techniques, and procedures (TTPs), indicators of compromise (IOCs), and detection methods associated with known Medusa ransomware activity.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Medusa is a ransomware-as-a-service variant used to conduct ransomware attacks; as of December 2024, over 300 victims from critical infrastructure sectors have been impacted.[0xc2][0xa0]Medusa actors use common techniques like phishing campaigns and exploiting unpatched software vulnerabilities.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Immediate actions organizations can take to mitigate Medusa ransomware activity:[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;Ensure operating systems, software, and firmware are patched and up to date.&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;Segment networks to restrict lateral movement.&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;Filter network traffic by preventing unknown or untrusted origins from accessing remote services.&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA encourages[0xc2][0xa0]network defenders to review the advisory and implement the recommended mitigations to reduce the likelihood and impact of Medusa ransomware incidents.[0xc2][0xa0]See &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/stopransomware&quot; title=&quot;#StopRansomware&quot;&gt;#StopRansomware&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/stopransomware/ransomware-guide&quot; title=&quot;#StopRansomware Guide&quot;&gt;#StopRansomware Guide&lt;/a&gt; for additional guidance on ransomware protection, detection, and response.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,572][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This product is provided subject to this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/notification&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Notification&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Notification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]and this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Website Privacy Policy&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; Use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
