[2025-04-15 21:50:33,601][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;You are subscribed to Cybersecurity Advisories for Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency. This information has recently been updated and is now available.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,601][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
