[2025-04-15 21:50:33,694][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-051-01 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-051-01&quot;&gt;ABB ASPECT-Enterprise, NEXUS, and MATRIX Series&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,694][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
