[2025-04-15 21:50:33,742][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,742][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
