[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDHSCISA/2020/06/3486054/05152023-gov-delivery-banner-copy_original.png&quot; alt=&quot;Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA)&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;You are subscribed to Cybersecurity Advisories for Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency. This information has recently been updated and is now available.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_item&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 2em;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_title&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 120%; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2025/02/04/cisa-partners-asds-acsc-cccs-ncsc-uk-and-other-international-and-us-organizations-release-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;CISA Partners with ASD[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s ACSC, CCCS, NCSC-UK, and Other International and US Organizations to Release Guidance on Edge Devices&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;CISA Partners with ASD[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s ACSC, CCCS, NCSC-UK, and Other International and US Organizations to Release Guidance on Edge Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_pub_date&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 90%; font-style: italic; color: #666666; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;02/04/2025 12:00 PM EST&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_description&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA[0xe2][0x80][0x94]in partnership with international and U.S. organizations[0xe2][0x80][0x94]released guidance to help organizations protect their network &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/guidance-and-strategies-protect-network-edge-devices&quot; title=&quot;Guidance and Strategies to Protect Network Edge Devices&quot;&gt;edge devices and appliances&lt;/a&gt;, such as firewalls, routers, virtual private networks (VPN) gateways, Internet of Things (IoT) devices, internet-facing servers, and internet-facing operational technology (OT) systems. The published guidance is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[0xe2][0x80][0x9c]Security Considerations for Edge Devices,[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] led by the Canadian Centre for Cyber Security (CCCS), a part of the Communications Security Establishment Canada.&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[0xe2][0x80][0x9c]Digital Forensics Monitoring Specifications for Products of Network Devices and Applications,[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] led by the United Kingdom[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s National Cyber Security Centre (NCSC-UK).&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,765][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[0xe2][0x80][0x9c]Mitigation Strategies for Edge Devices: Executive "
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,766][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "Guidance[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] and [0xe2][0x80][0x9c]Mitigation Strategies for Edge Devices: Practitioner Guidance,[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] two separate guides led by the Australian Signals Directorate[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s Australian Cyber Security Centre (ASD[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s ACSC).&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,766][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,766][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Foreign adversaries routinely exploit software vulnerabilities in network edge devices to infiltrate critical infrastructure networks and systems. The damage can be expensive, time-consuming, and reputationally catastrophic for public and private sector organizations. These guidance documents detail various considerations and strategies for a more secure and resilient network both before and after a compromise.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,766][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA and partner agencies urge device manufacturers and critical infrastructure owners and operators to review and implement the recommended actions and mitigations in the publications. Device manufacturers, please visit CISA[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/securebydesign&quot; title=&quot;Secure by Design&quot;&gt;Secure by Design&lt;/a&gt; page for more information on how to align development processes with the goal of reducing the prevalence of vulnerabilities in devices. Critical infrastructure owners and operators, please see &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/secure-demand-priority-considerations-operational-technology-owners-and-operators-when-selecting&quot; title=&quot;Secure by Demand: Priority Considerations for Operational Technology Owners and Operators when Selecting Digital Products&quot;&gt;Secure by Demand: Priority Considerations for Operational Technology Owners and Operators when Selecting Digital Products&lt;/a&gt; for guidance on procuring secure products.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:33,766][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This product is provided subject to this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/notification&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Notification&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Notification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]and this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Website Privacy Policy&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; Use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
