&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;listItem ultext&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgb(26, 26, 26);&quot;&gt;Why insider threats often resemble attacks orchestrated by threat actor groups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;listItem ultext&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgb(26, 26, 26);&quot;&gt;How security teams can better monitor for anomalous behavior in their own environments to detect insider threats early&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;center&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;color:#2A2A2A;font-weight:normal;padding:0px 15px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;color:#2A2A2A;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[0xf0][0x9f][0x91][0x89]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgb(44, 129, 229);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgb(44, 129, 229);&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.auRSRRlK5DEX07mczgW1EJkFBNU4bvuVvjh-pNai5QXcynqNaLe9REjABydG3LW1FYmW-yY7S8KAMx61KvAEzS5f3s6mYWkrjiDbCtF9hLeE39ddQj6Gw6kRZXmSTxF6uupHthyED_7oPR4h0zRObDVoMovIzA8r9HPpHSiNpugmKJ8eQTIoPdZDquCnr0U9efq4FuGT7EuIHEUt-vG9yWKrJKDeUmMYNYJqIqlsCr46J4fxQJHJq7Zp5QYhd9Zm_vIAshCH3eiAKe7_J19KV0Kkfv8fs2RVg-1n3_BFkQRv2Y7i6_r1MFN5Xd06lo6DT5LLo5l9WnINFxDHVCyLiw/4fc/MMI6n3VFSkOR4zVEmIUHhw/h3/h001.gnWe9NDzqHe9yJh52XfhR5gI4mvkEZW0zGMOZkOK_Eo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Register&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[0xf0][0x9f][0x91][0x88]&lt;/b&