reason for the observed state. [0xe2][0x80][0x9c]Often, the statistics presented are as much a reflection of limitation in collected or analyzed data, or the product, as any specific research perspective.[0xe2][0x80][0x9d]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt; [0xf0][0x9f][0x92][0xa1]&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt; I like this angle, and in general I think as an industry we should do a better job at critically analyzing [0xe2][0x80][0x9c]state of the union[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] type reports, evaluations/benchmarks, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.-QQnKmN9995ElcpR565ShwPFeE2dDyO14Xqz8fR5FCCCmKojDhVXTKDXLz6dxsXb3WGk455S2y9poTciWH8JmbUGxRrFuB_FZwnuiAl_Ghvtu3qNXPXDrsCBXAPwLuTlI_JvRHC3No6LL_x4ePJkdEcxv0g2QjOAkKzEiBnoXnpY1H1eUKyBtLisNmD5SUy5xuKFN_lgax1E3kELorROsTWRTnQh02g6pubsFnmaJTicnMosHpg1Mn-ndME49p9BvojlUljIHFUfH-hyANquztDCoTYRbgHzGzr7sDOD3xOTrIJWTi5LS90JJch1ecF2qX95bQbk0Lc6yN4LkYHf1B2LNHpalyZq5Ku2J8dyQVUZD5QF0XnwoCAYrT0pjqBpg4pGL2rkn_1WAC_syDwMgQ/4f5/Bfq3makRTpKF0Npi0qUnIA/h22/h001.MCG54DJXpsE7D3dnmn5ksnDcnEBfOE-GDGXVRN1tSEc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Beyond Configuration Perfection: Redefining [0xe2][0x80][0x98]Cloud Security[0xe2][0x80][0x99]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&